<title>GERMANY: Loesch Umweltschutz shares priced at 25 dmk in IPO.</title>
<headline>Loesch Umweltschutz shares priced at 25 dmk in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German waste disposal company Loesch Umweltschutz AG will issue two million five-mark shares at 25 marks per share in an initial public offering, lead-manager Dresdner Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue has been 17 times oversubscribed, with strong demand from domestic as well as foreign investors, Dresdner said in a statement.</p>
<p>The issue price is at the upper end of the 22 to 25 mark range announced recently.</p>
<p>The shares will be listed on the Frankfurt stock exchange.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
